":"Yūtenji Nyamu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima the Raging Tide","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zinogre S Catapult","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zuo Le","rarity":6,"isFuture":null}],"techniqueUnitIcons":{},"techniqueBranchOperators":{},"techniqueGroupOperators":{},"techniqueRelatedOperators":{"Self-Sustain":{"entries":[{"name":"Blemishine","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Entelechia","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Executor the Ex Foedere","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Hoshiguma the Breacher","rarity":6,"isFuture":null}],"totalCount":96}},"forms":null,"skillRanges":null,"overviewRanges":[{"elite":0,"talent":null,"range":{"cols":2,"rows":1,"opCell":[1,1],"rangeCells":[[1,2]]}}],"voiceData":{"textLocale":"en","lines":[{"id":"CN_001","title":"Appointed as Assistant","text":"Uh... w-where should I stand? O-oh, you want me to sit? Then... where should I sit?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":1},{"id":"CN_002","title":"Talk 1","text":"That little bird is my friend. But it's always disappearing on me these days... Oh no... It's not disliking me, is it...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":2},{"id":"CN_003","title":"Talk 2","text":"The way I look... is nothing like an Operator at all... And I understand having someone like me in your team won't make you pround... But don't worry, I won't go around saying I'm with Rhodes Island.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":3},{"id":"CN_004","title":"Talk 3","text":"You've probably noticed, but my hair is quite difficult to style... So I have to let my hair down like this... It's not very appropriate, is it?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":4},{"id":"CN_005","title":"Talk after Promotion 1","text":"My mutant horns... they don't really fit in with the crowd... I thought I was used to other people staring at them... but … but it's still embarrassing...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":5},{"id":"CN_006","title":"Talk after Promotion 2","text":"The friends I made in the wilderness... they're all coming to Rhodes Island too. So... I'll feel less lonely. I'll do my best to fight hard and protect everyone.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":6},{"id":"CN_007","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","text":"Actually, ever since my childhood, I've always been dreaming to be a... a princess... I-I mean it's okay if you find it ridiculous...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":7},{"id":"CN_008","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","text":"The bad guys always call me 'freak'... but… yeah, I'm a freak, a freak that wants to protect you and everyone else.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":8},{"id":"CN_009","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","text":"Um... that really energetic doctor... she's an Archosaurian too, huh? I do want to talk to her... but I'm still a bit scared…","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":9},{"id":"CN_010","title":"Idle","text":"No one's staring at me now, right? Ah, finally...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":10},{"id":"CN_011","title":"Onboard","text":"H-hello... Uh... s-sorry, my horns... I accidentally broke your office door with my horns...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":11},{"id":"CN_012","title":"Watching Battle Record","text":"Powers stronger than what I already have... can I really control them...?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":12},{"id":"CN_013","title":"Promotion 1","text":"Promotion? What's that?... I don't really get it, but I think it means that I've been helpful, right?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":13},{"id":"CN_014","title":"Promotion 2","text":"Thank you, Doctor, for giving me a bit more confidence... Now I am starting to understand what to do and how to wield my power.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":14},{"id":"CN_017","title":"Added to Squad","text":"P-please don't look at me...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":17},{"id":"CN_018","title":"Appointed as Squad Leader","text":"Wahh... me? R-really? Is that really okay?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":18},{"id":"CN_019","title":"Depart","text":"Uh, everyone... it's... it's time to attack! I-is this how I'm supposed to give orders?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":19},{"id":"CN_020","title":"Begin Operation","text":"I... I won't let the bad guys win!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":20},{"id":"CN_021","title":"Selecting Operator 1","text":"Huh? Me?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":21},{"id":"CN_022","title":"Selecting Operator 2","text":"Let me do it!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":22},{"id":"CN_023","title":"Deployment 1","text":"My pushover look should pull a lot of enemies here...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":23},{"id":"CN_024","title":"Deployment 2","text":"To intimidate the enemy... I... I'm capable of that, right?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":24},{"id":"CN_025","title":"In Battle 1","text":"Hah!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":25},{"id":"CN_026","title":"In Battle 2","text":"I-I won't let you pass!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":26},{"id":"CN_027","title":"In Battle 3","text":"I won't let you escape this easily!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":27},{"id":"CN_028","title":"In Battle 4","text":"Fear me, please!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":28},{"id":"CN_029","title":"4-star Result","text":"I can do better... yes, even better!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":29},{"id":"CN_030","title":"3-star Result","text":"Are you proud of what we've achieved, Doctor?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":30},{"id":"CN_031","title":"Sub 3-star Result","text":"Great... we won, Doctor!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":31},{"id":"CN_032","title":"Operation Failure","text":"In the end... I'm good for nothing... just as expected...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":32},{"id":"CN_033","title":"Assigned to Facility","text":"Wow, this place... it's so spacious! I love it!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":33},{"id":"CN_034","title":"Tap","text":"Um...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":34},{"id":"CN_036","title":"Trust Tap","text":"You're always so kind to me... I... I'm so happy!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":36},{"id":"CN_037","title":"Title","text":"Arknights.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":37},{"id":"CN_038","title":"New Year's blessing","text":"Happy New Year, Doctor... My wish is to get along better with everyone. Will I be able to do that? And make more friends as well... is that allowed? Having friends...","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":38},{"id":"CN_042","title":"Greeting","text":"D-Doctor...","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":42},{"id":"CN_043","title":"Birthday","text":"Doctor, this is a gift I made... My friend on my head shed a bunch of feathers, which I made into a pendant. I hope you like it...","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":43},{"id":"CN_044","title":"Anniversary Celebration","text":"Fighting makes me feel useful... You've always thought so? T-Thanks, Doctor... And outside of battle as well? I... Gavial and Tomimi said so too? Am I... dreaming?","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":44}],"packs":[{"id":"en","label":"English","actors":["Clare Corbett"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-english/main/current/char_127_estell/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"jp","label":"Japanese","actors":["Nozomi Yamamoto"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-japanese/main/current/char_127_estell/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"cn","label":"Mandarin","actors":["Mia Miao"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-mandarin/main/current/char_127_estell/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"kr","label":"Korean","actors":["Kim Seo-young"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-korean/main/current/char_127_estell/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"}]}}}